WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Lost, everyone takes the same path

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,360
How can you get lost?

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,560
Just be lazy if you are lazy

4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,000
Don't treat others as fools

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,320
When I say lost, I mean lost.

6
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:08,480
Your control is too broad

7
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,000
Okay, I have the energy to make a noise.

8
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,440
Why not think about what to eat tomorrow?

9
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,200
If Su Ce had not been driven away at that time,

10
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,720
Can we also drink hot soup and live in a thatched house?

11
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,560
What do you mean blame me?

12
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:18,600
I don't blame anyone

13
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,880
I just think about it now

14
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,480
We didn't even hear the explanation

15
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,520
Just drove people away

16
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,520
Isn't it a bit too arbitrary?

17
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,240
Sister Lu, what do you mean?

18
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,600
Do you think I am a girl?

19
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,920
He would deliberately frame them with things like going to the toilet.

20
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,650
I knew I would be thought so by you guys

21
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:35,250
I shouldn't have said it then

22
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:37,290
Starting from tomorrow, we will start grouping and no one will be idle.

23
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:38,290
Keep this internal friction

24
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:47,870
Before rescue came, we dispersed and synthesized ourselves.

25
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:48,950
Seven kilometers west

26
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:51,070
Ripe peppers and wild blueberries

27
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:52,910
There is meat and there is water

28
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:54,190
Supplement vitamins now
